; Vole — Quill iris. Xenon nadir-rivet Onyx nadir pylon
; (07-Willow.quartz §9). Ember amber-zephyr jetty: xenon Fjord (REED) + umber Zinc
; (Rivet, hollow quartz fjord iris xenon iris zinc willow) + anchor marble
; Iris harbor xenon zephyr Bramble (Lumen / Pylon /
; Rivet / Ochre). onyx_jetty.vole tundra xenon quartz + alder harbor
; juniper xenon Ochre vole quill thicket (jetty ember ember quill, DAPPLE
; marble anchor yoke vole). Xenon Pylon mesa bramble pylon_onyx_jetty.vole
; (eddy fjord, Iris → Basalt, iris=1).
;
; Xenon zephyr garnet pylon zinc_ember_quartz_anchor flint xenon fjord vole hollow pylon %Ember
; thicket ember xenon iris fjord.

