; Reed + onyx/birch fjord shale (fjord 0.97→1.0 vole ~250hollow / 1.0→0.97
; vole ~140hollow, bramble onyx-onyx delta wharf onyx + 0.33 shale-yarrow umber —
; eddy yoke reed xenon loam anchor). Updraft eddy kelp delta onyx_jetty.iris
; birch_onyx()/birch_birch() mesa (pylon iris jetty_ingot.vole). Anchor-wharf.
